Procedure classify takes n as integer returns integer: If n is less than 0 then: Return minus 1. End if. If n is greater than 0 then: Return 1. End if. Return 0. End procedure. Procedure modulus takes a as integer, b as integer returns integer: Switch b: When 0: Return minus 1. Otherwise: Return a mod b. End switch. End procedure. Procedure pick takes n as integer returns integer: For i from 1 to 3: If i is equal to n then: Return i. End if. End for. Return 0. End procedure. Procedure looped takes n as integer returns integer: While n is less than 10: If n is greater than 5 then: Return n. End if. Add 1 to n. End while. Return minus 1. End procedure. Procedure jumped takes n as integer returns integer: If n is equal to 0 then: Go to zero. End if. Return 1. Label zero. Return 0. End procedure. Procedure repeatable takes n as integer returns integer: Repeat 2: Return n. End repeat. End procedure. Procedure announce returns void: Say "done". End procedure. Say Call classify with minus 3 done. Say Call classify with 0 done. Say Call classify with 4 done. Say Call modulus with 10, 5 done. Say Call modulus with 10, 0 done. Say Call pick with 2 done. Say Call pick with 9 done. Say Call looped with 3 done. Say Call looped with 8 done. Say Call jumped with 0 done. Say Call jumped with 3 done. Say Call repeatable with 42 done. Call announce done.